    m_Localized: Camp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2915066992287744
    m_Localized: 'When you score {value} points, you have the opportunity to go to
      the camp. You can relax and restore your health in the camp.


      You need
      to score another {value_2} points to be able to go to the camp'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2923622437117952
    m_Localized: Level of toad
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2923687335583744
    m_Localized: The toad has reached his maximum level.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2923653076508672
    m_Localized: 'The toad''s level increases for the score points earned. For each
      level increase, the toad is rewarded with new abilities.


      Be careful,
      the higher the level of the toad, the more powerful his enemies are.


      The
      toad will get the next level when he scores {value} points.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2926526246051840
    m_Localized: The final test
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2926622576631808
    m_Localized: 'To complete the run, you need to pass the final test.


      The
      final test will begin when the toad scores 1 500 points and reaches the camp.'
